{"unit_id":"Unintendedz__dsh-session-workspace#card-zh","repo":"Unintendedz/dsh-session-workspace","commit":"cedbfe9d4d55360da20e19024bc2edfd6a619a37","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-workspace 是供 DSH Web 使用的会话迁移插件：它在会话侧边栏菜单加入“移动到其他工作区”入口，并通过宿主 RPC 查询会话状态和执行迁移。用户可以选择已注册的目标工作区，将已关闭会话的 JSONL generation 连同当前 cwd 一起迁移，同时更新工作区索引和归属；迁移前校验完整会话内容、目标位置和源文件变化，原 generation 会留下备份。适合需要整理工作区、但希望保留会话 ID 和历史的 DSH Web 用户。无需 API Key；需宿主提供兼容的 JSONL 持久化与工作区注册接口。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:41-71","src/migration.js:188-302","src/client.js:243-285","cordis.patch.yml:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"Unintendedz__dsh-session-workspace#card-en","repo":"Unintendedz/dsh-session-workspace","commit":"cedbfe9d4d55360da20e19024bc2edfd6a619a37","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-workspace moves a closed DSH Web session to another registered workspace from a sidebar action. It updates the session path and index, preserves the session ID and JSONL history, and backs up original generations. Compatible DSH persistence and workspace registry interfaces are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:41-71","src/migration.js:188-302","src/client.js:243-285","cordis.patch.yml:1-4"]}
