{"unit_id":"Unintendedz__dsh-session-workspace#caveat-1","repo":"Unintendedz/dsh-session-workspace","commit":"cedbfe9d4d55360da20e19024bc2edfd6a619a37","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-workspace 使用前须知：只能迁移已关闭的会话，且目标必须是不同的已注册工作区；活动会话、当前工作区或已有目标 generation 会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/migration.js:322-345","src/migration.js:229-235"]}
